title: Authorizations › Queue › Read and open a request tile
route: /authorizations
intro: What each part of a request tile says, which parts are links, and where the chance, status and due text come from.
dir: TD
also: Only the request ID, the 'Open' button and the 'Coverage needs a fix' pill are clickable. The rest of the tile does nothing.
---
screen t "Request tile\nOne open request inside a band"

group gL "Left side"
  process lv "Level chip\nResidential 3.5, PHP, IOP, or 'Detox → Residential'"
  process id "'R-1042 · J.M., 34 · Summit Medicaid HMO'"
  process dx "Diagnosis and review type\n'Alcohol use disorder, severe ... · admission'"
  process sc "Scores with a trend arrow\n'AUDIT-C 11 · PHQ-9 17 ↑'\nRising, falling or unchanged"
endgroup

decision dR "Has every check passed after actions applied on the case page?"
agent ag1 "Integrity badge\n'Ready to sign. Integrity passed all four checks'"
agent ag2 "The agent on the request, e.g. Scribe\n'Scribe is drafting the case'"
decision dN "Needs your input, and not ready?"
toast pn "Pill 'Needs your input'"
decision dC "Does coverage need a fix?"
click cl "Click the 'Coverage needs a fix' pill"
goto gE "Continues in: Eligibility & Benefits › Verify a patient"
decision dRule "Rule note on the request, and not ready?"
process rule "Green note under the status\ne.g. 'Summit expects a named step-down provider with the first request.'"

group gR "Right side"
  process due "Due pill, e.g. 'Notice due in 5 h'\nUnder 48 h: 'in 40 min' or 'in 5 h'. Later: 'Decision Thu'. Past: '... now'"
  process risk "Pill '$22.4K at risk'"
  process ch "Approval chance bar and number\nStrong 80+, Moderate 55–79, At risk below 55"
  process lift "Line under the word\n'+26 pts once drafted', 'waiting on the payer', 'chance to overturn', 'on track'"
endgroup

decision dA "Were actions applied on the case page?"
process ch2 "Bar shows the new chance\nLine reads '+N pts possible' or 'on track'"
process ch3 "Bar shows the request's own chance and line"
process nr "No note line"
process tint "Tiles in Act now have a red tint\nOther bands are neutral"

click idl "Click the request ID (underlined)"
click ob "Click 'Open'"
goto gC "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Ways in"

t --> lv --> id --> dx --> sc
t --> dR
dR -->|Yes| ag1
dR -->|No| ag2 --> dN
dN -->|Yes| pn
dN -->|No| dC
pn --> dC
dC -->|Yes| cl --> gE
dC -->|No| dRule
dRule -->|Yes| rule
dRule -->|No| nr
t --> due --> risk --> ch --> lift --> dA
dA -->|Yes| ch2
dA -->|No| ch3
t --> tint
t --> idl --> gC
t --> ob --> gC
